# Goal: empty -- perception re-digitizes whatever the camera currently sees
# when this goal is accepted; there is nothing else to configure per-solve.
# Separator: ends the (empty) goal section, begins the result section.
---
# Whether the maze was solved successfully.
bool success
# Human-readable success/failure detail.
string message
# Separator: ends the result section, begins the feedback section.
---
# Which stage of the solve cycle is currently running.
string stage
